{ dg-modules "rcprelude" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Assertions", ALGOL 68 solution assertions-1.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Assertions#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/assertions-1.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Rc_Prelude (
op      assert = (VECTOR [] char assertion,bool valid) void:
if      NOT valid
then    type_line_on_terminal(assertion);
        terminal_error( 661 {invalid assertion } )
fi;
)
